      "statement": "Database opening is a forward-only transactional migration boundary: `connect_database()` enables foreign keys, bounds the busy timeout, migrates within `BEGIN IMMEDIATE`, rejects unsupported schema versions, runs an integrity check, and applies owner-only file permissions; the read-only connector refuses a non-current schema and cannot migrate it.",
